# CCD codes are NOT SMILES. This file exists to pin the refusal: loaded in
# SMILES mode, each line is checked by the SMILES grammar (validation/smiles.py)
# and refused, so the run writes nothing. It is never stored as notation and no
# output ever carries "smiles": "ATP". A code entry needs the CCD code input
# type, which writes "ccdCodes" instead (see ligands_ccd_codes.txt).
atp ATP
zinc ZN
